{"id":"0284091d2e6abc2a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/298_Hrbacek_集合论_HST.md","title":"298 Hrbacek 集合论 HST","display":"298_Hrbacek_集合论_HST","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"298-Hrbacek-集合论-HST\">298 Hrbacek 集合论 HST</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-三谓词集合语言\">1. 三谓词集合语言</h1>\n<p>变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_{HST}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}_{HST}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{HST}\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{HST}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{HST}(U)=v_m,\n\\qquad m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{HST}(U)=v_m,\n\\qquad m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项只有变量项。原子构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\doteq y,\\quad x\\in y,\\quad S(x),\\quad I(x),\\quad F(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\doteq y,\\quad x\\in y,\\quad S(x),\\quad I(x),\\quad F(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 表示标准，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 表示内部，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 表示有限。逻辑构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\neg,\\to,\\forall x\">\\(\\bot,\\neg,\\to,\\forall x\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\">\\(A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST}\\)</span>，派生符号逐一定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg A,\n\\qquad\nA\\wedge C:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists x\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg A,\n\\qquad\nA\\wedge C:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\vee C:=\\neg A\\to C,\n\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow C:=(A\\to C)\\wedge(C\\to A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\vee C:=\\neg A\\to C,\n\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow C:=(A\\to C)\\wedge(C\\to A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\subseteq y:=\\forall z(z\\in x\\to z\\in y),\n\\qquad z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{HST}(\\{x,y\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\subseteq y:=\\forall z(z\\in x\\to z\\in y),\n\\qquad z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{HST}(\\{x,y\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些记号都只是宏；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{HST}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{HST}\\)</span> 对它们的作用，均定义为先按上述等式完全展开，再使用第 3 节的原始构造子条款。标准量词和内部量词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall^Sx\\,A:=\\forall x(S(x)\\to A),\\quad\n\\exists^Sx\\,A:=\\exists x(S(x)\\wedge A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall^Sx\\,A:=\\forall x(S(x)\\to A),\\quad\n\\exists^Sx\\,A:=\\exists x(S(x)\\wedge A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall^Ix\\,A:=\\forall x(I(x)\\to A),\\quad\n\\exists^Ix\\,A:=\\exists x(I(x)\\wedge A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall^Ix\\,A:=\\forall x(I(x)\\to A),\\quad\n\\exists^Ix\\,A:=\\exists x(I(x)\\wedge A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in a\\,A:=\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A)\">\\(\\forall x\\in a\\,A:=\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A)\\)</span>、\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\in a\\,A:=\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge A)\">\\(\\exists x\\in a\\,A:=\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本语言只有一个“集合”论域；为使三层边界可在对象语言中审计，定义域谓词缩写为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Set_{HST}(x):=x\\doteq x,\\qquad StdSet(x):=S(x),\\qquad\nIntSet(x):=I(x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Set_{HST}(x):=x\\doteq x,\\qquad StdSet(x):=S(x),\\qquad\nIntSet(x):=I(x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"ExtSet(x):=\\neg I(x),\\qquad FinIntSet(x):=F(x)\\wedge I(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[ExtSet(x):=\\neg I(x),\\qquad FinIntSet(x):=F(x)\\wedge I(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ExtSet\">\\(ExtSet\\)</span> 表示真正位于内部宇宙之外的外部集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 只表示“有限”，不再被误当成第三层级。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式闭包与内部公式\">2. 公式闭包与内部公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\\)</span> 由变量项生成。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>等词和成员为公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(t)\">\\(S(t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I(t)\">\\(I(t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(t)\">\\(F(t)\\)</span> 为公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to C,\\forall x\\,A\">\\(\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to C,\\forall x\\,A\\)</span> 为公式。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>内部公式谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Int}_{HST}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Int}_{HST}(A)\\)</span> 是满足下列条款的最小谓词：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>等词和成员原子为内部公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 为内部公式。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,C\">\\(A,C\\)</span> 为内部公式，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to C\">\\(A\\to C\\)</span> 为内部公式。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为内部公式，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,A\">\\(\\forall x\\,A\\)</span> 为内部公式。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(t),I(t),F(t)\">\\(S(t),I(t),F(t)\\)</span> 原子均不进入内部公式。标准公式谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StdFrm}_{HST}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{StdFrm}_{HST}(A)\\)</span> 是由等词、成员、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(t)\">\\(S(t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\neg,\\to,\\forall x\">\\(\\bot,\\neg,\\to,\\forall x\\)</span> 闭合生成的最小谓词；有限层级公式谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinFrm}_{HST}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{FinFrm}_{HST}(A)\\)</span> 是由等词、成员、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(t)\">\\(F(t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\neg,\\to,\\forall x\">\\(\\bot,\\neg,\\to,\\forall x\\)</span> 闭合生成的最小谓词。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-alpha-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 alpha 等价</h1>\n<p>项自由变量函数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\}\\)</span>。公式自由变量函数逐构造子定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(u\\doteq v)=\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(u)\\cup\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(v),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(u\\in v)=\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(u)\\cup\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(v),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(u\\doteq v)=\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(u)\\cup\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(v),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(u\\in v)=\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(u)\\cup\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(v),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(S(u))=\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(I(u))=\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(F(u))=\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(u),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(S(u))=\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(I(u))=\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(F(u))=\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(u),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A\\to C)=\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A\\to C)=\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义项替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubTerm}_{HST}:\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{HST}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{HST},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubTerm}_{HST}:\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{HST}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{HST},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubTerm}_{HST}(\\operatorname{var}(y),x,t)=\n\\begin{cases}t,&amp;y=x,\\\\ \\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubTerm}_{HST}(\\operatorname{var}(y),x,t)=\n\\begin{cases}t,&amp;y=x,\\\\ \\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换的类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{HST}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{HST}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并在公式上满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u\\doteq v)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]\\doteq v[x:=t]),\\quad\n(u\\in v)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]\\in v[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u\\doteq v)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]\\doteq v[x:=t]),\\quad\n(u\\in v)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]\\in v[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S(u)[x:=t]=S(u[x:=t]),\\quad I(u)[x:=t]=I(u[x:=t]),\\quad F(u)[x:=t]=F(u[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S(u)[x:=t]=S(u[x:=t]),\\quad I(u)[x:=t]=I(u[x:=t]),\\quad F(u)[x:=t]=F(u[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\\quad(\\neg A)[x:=t]=\\neg(A[x:=t]),\\quad(A\\to C)[x:=t]=(A[x:=t]\\to C[x:=t]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\\quad(\\neg A)[x:=t]=\\neg(A[x:=t]),\\quad(A\\to C)[x:=t]=(A[x:=t]\\to C[x:=t]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全称量词替换子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall y\\,A)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall y\\,A,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y\\,(A[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z\\,((A[y:=z])[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(t),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall y\\,A)[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall y\\,A,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y\\,(A[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z\\,((A[y:=z])[x:=t]),&amp;y\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(t),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{HST}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{HST}\\)</span> 为所有等价关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 对等词、成员、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,I,F\">\\(S,I,F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\neg,\\to,\\forall\">\\(\\bot,\\neg,\\to,\\forall\\)</span> 相容，并包含上述全称绑定变量 fresh 改名对。</p>\n<p>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}\\)</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{HST}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{HST}\\)</span>。绑定变量函数在全部原子与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 上取空集，并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(A\\to C)=\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(A\\to C)=\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(\\forall x\\,A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(\\forall x\\,A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{HST}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-内部集合公理核心\">4. 内部集合公理核心</h1>\n<p>逻辑公理族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{HST}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{HST}\\)</span> 为下列集合的并集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{A\\to(C\\to A):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{A\\to(C\\to A):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(A\\to(C\\to D))\\to((A\\to C)\\to(A\\to D)):A,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(A\\to(C\\to D))\\to((A\\to C)\\to(A\\to D)):A,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg C)\\to(C\\to A)):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg C)\\to(C\\to A)):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(\\forall x\\,A)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(A,x,t):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(\\forall x\\,A)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(A,x,t):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(\\forall x(A\\to C))\\to(A\\to\\forall xC):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(\\forall x(A\\to C))\\to(A\\to\\forall xC):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{u\\doteq v\\to(\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(A,x,u)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(A,x,v)):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST},u,v\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{u\\doteq v\\to(\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(A,x,u)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(A,x,v)):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST},u,v\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{HST}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>集合构造公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Set}^{HST}=\n\\{\\forall x\\,\\forall y(\\forall z(z\\in x\\leftrightarrow z\\in y)\\to x\\doteq y)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Set}^{HST}=\n\\{\\forall x\\,\\forall y(\\forall z(z\\in x\\leftrightarrow z\\in y)\\to x\\doteq y)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{\\exists e(I(e)\\wedge\\forall z\\,\\neg(z\\in e))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{\\exists e(I(e)\\wedge\\forall z\\,\\neg(z\\in e))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{\\forall a\\,\\forall b\\,\\exists p(\\forall z(z\\in p\\leftrightarrow(z\\doteq a\\vee z\\doteq b))\n\\wedge((I(a)\\wedge I(b))\\to I(p)))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{\\forall a\\,\\forall b\\,\\exists p(\\forall z(z\\in p\\leftrightarrow(z\\doteq a\\vee z\\doteq b))\n\\wedge((I(a)\\wedge I(b))\\to I(p)))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{\\forall a\\exists u(\\forall z(z\\in u\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(z\\in y\\wedge y\\in a))\n\\wedge(I(a)\\to I(u)))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{\\forall a\\exists u(\\forall z(z\\in u\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(z\\in y\\wedge y\\in a))\n\\wedge(I(a)\\to I(u)))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{\\forall a\\exists p(\\forall z(z\\in p\\leftrightarrow z\\subseteq a)\\wedge(I(a)\\to I(p)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{\\forall a\\exists p(\\forall z(z\\in p\\leftrightarrow z\\subseteq a)\\wedge(I(a)\\to I(p)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>内部分离与替代分别定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sep}^{HST}=\n\\{\\forall a(I(a)\\to\\exists b(I(b)\\wedge\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow x\\in a\\wedge\\varphi))):\n\\operatorname{Int}_{HST}(\\varphi),\\ a,b,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},\n|\\{a,b,x\\}|=3,\\ b\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\varphi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sep}^{HST}=\n\\{\\forall a(I(a)\\to\\exists b(I(b)\\wedge\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow x\\in a\\wedge\\varphi))):\n\\operatorname{Int}_{HST}(\\varphi),\\ a,b,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},\n|\\{a,b,x\\}|=3,\\ b\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\varphi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Rep}^{HST}=\n\\{\\forall a((I(a)\\wedge\n(\\forall x\\in a\\,\\exists y\\,\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(\\varphi,y,\\operatorname{var}(y)))\\wedge\n\\forall x\\in a\\,\\forall y\\,\\forall z(\n(\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(\\varphi,y,\\operatorname{var}(y))\\wedge\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(\\varphi,y,\\operatorname{var}(z)))\\to y\\doteq z))\n\\to\n\\exists b(I(b)\\wedge\\forall y(y\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists x\\in a\\,\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(\\varphi,y,\\operatorname{var}(y))))):\n\\operatorname{Int}_{HST}(\\varphi),\\ a,b,x,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},\n|\\{a,b,x,y,z\\}|=5,\\ b\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\varphi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Rep}^{HST}=\n\\{\\forall a((I(a)\\wedge\n(\\forall x\\in a\\,\\exists y\\,\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(\\varphi,y,\\operatorname{var}(y)))\\wedge\n\\forall x\\in a\\,\\forall y\\,\\forall z(\n(\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(\\varphi,y,\\operatorname{var}(y))\\wedge\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(\\varphi,y,\\operatorname{var}(z)))\\to y\\doteq z))\n\\to\n\\exists b(I(b)\\wedge\\forall y(y\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists x\\in a\\,\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}(\\varphi,y,\\operatorname{var}(y))))):\n\\operatorname{Int}_{HST}(\\varphi),\\ a,b,x,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},\n|\\{a,b,x,y,z\\}|=5,\\ b\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\varphi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SepRep}^{HST}:=\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sep}^{HST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Rep}^{HST}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SepRep}^{HST}:=\\mathsf{Ax}_{Sep}^{HST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Rep}^{HST}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-HST-标准、内部与扩大公理\">5. HST 标准、内部与扩大公理</h1>\n<p>层级公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Level}^{HST}=\n\\{S(x)\\to I(x)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{F(x)\\to I(x)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{I(x)\\wedge y\\in x\\to I(y)\\}\n\\cup\\{I(x)\\to\\exists^S a\\,(x\\in a)\\}\n\\cup\\{ExtSet(x)\\leftrightarrow\\neg IntSet(x)\\}\n\\cup\\{Set_{HST}(x)\\leftrightarrow(StdSet(x)\\vee(IntSet(x)\\wedge\\neg StdSet(x))\\vee ExtSet(x))\\}\n\\cup\\{\\exists x\\,ExtSet(x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Level}^{HST}=\n\\{S(x)\\to I(x)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{F(x)\\to I(x)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{I(x)\\wedge y\\in x\\to I(y)\\}\n\\cup\\{I(x)\\to\\exists^S a\\,(x\\in a)\\}\n\\cup\\{ExtSet(x)\\leftrightarrow\\neg IntSet(x)\\}\n\\cup\\{Set_{HST}(x)\\leftrightarrow(StdSet(x)\\vee(IntSet(x)\\wedge\\neg StdSet(x))\\vee ExtSet(x))\\}\n\\cup\\{\\exists x\\,ExtSet(x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>最后一项是分层的非坍缩句。</p>\n<p>前四式给出桥接链：标准集合是内部集合；有限对象在本条目中被限定为内部有限集合；内部集合的元素仍内部；每个内部集合属于某个标准集合。最后两式固定“标准 / 非标准内部 / 外部”的穷尽且互斥分层。</p>\n<p>标准转移公理族为</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec p=(p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1})\">\\(\\vec p=(p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1})\\)</span> 是两两不同的变量列，令\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall^S\\vec p\">\\(\\forall^S\\vec p\\)</span> 表示迭代标准量词（空列省略）。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Transfer}^{HST}=\n\\{\\forall^S\\vec p((\\forall^Sx\\,\\varphi(x,\\vec p))\\to\\forall^Ix\\,\\varphi(x,\\vec p)):\n\\operatorname{Int}_{HST}(\\varphi),\n\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1}\\},\nx,p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1}\\text{ 两两不同}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Transfer}^{HST}=\n\\{\\forall^S\\vec p((\\forall^Sx\\,\\varphi(x,\\vec p))\\to\\forall^Ix\\,\\varphi(x,\\vec p)):\n\\operatorname{Int}_{HST}(\\varphi),\n\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1}\\},\nx,p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1}\\text{ 两两不同}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>标准化公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Standard}^{HST}=\n\\{\\forall^SA\\,\\exists^SB\\,\\forall^Sx(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow(x\\in A\\wedge\\psi(x,\\vec p))):\n\\psi\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST},\\ A,B,x,p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1}\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x,p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1}\\},\nA,B\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\psi),\nA,B,x,p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1}\\text{ 两两不同}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Standard}^{HST}=\n\\{\\forall^SA\\,\\exists^SB\\,\\forall^Sx(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow(x\\in A\\wedge\\psi(x,\\vec p))):\n\\psi\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST},\\ A,B,x,p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1}\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x,p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1}\\},\nA,B\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(\\psi),\nA,B,x,p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1}\\text{ 两两不同}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>扩大公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StdFIP}_{HST}(A):=\\forall^S D\n((F(D)\\wedge D\\subseteq A)\\to\\exists^I y\\,\\forall X\\in D\\,(y\\in X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StdFIP}_{HST}(A):=\\forall^S D\n((F(D)\\wedge D\\subseteq A)\\to\\exists^I y\\,\\forall X\\in D\\,(y\\in X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Enlarge}^{HST}=\n\\{\\forall^S A((\\forall X\\in A\\,I(X)\\wedge\\operatorname{StdFIP}_{HST}(A))\n\\to\\exists^I y\\,\\forall^S X(X\\in A\\to y\\in X))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Enlarge}^{HST}=\n\\{\\forall^S A((\\forall X\\in A\\,I(X)\\wedge\\operatorname{StdFIP}_{HST}(A))\n\\to\\exists^I y\\,\\forall^S X(X\\in A\\to y\\in X))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 Enlargement 针对的是“标准内部集合族的标准有限交性质”，而不是一个含有所有标准对象的万能内部集合。</p>\n<p>总公理集合为</p>\n<p>按变量指标固定全序，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cl}_{HST}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{cl}_{HST}(A)\\)</span> 为全称量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(A)\\)</span> 中全部变量所得闭公式。令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Theory}^{HST}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{Set}^{HST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SepRep}^{HST}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Level}^{HST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Transfer}^{HST}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Standard}^{HST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Enlarge}^{HST}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Theory}^{HST}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{Set}^{HST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SepRep}^{HST}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Level}^{HST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Transfer}^{HST}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Standard}^{HST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Enlarge}^{HST}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{HST}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{HST}\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{cl}_{HST}(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Theory}^{HST}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{HST}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{HST}\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{cl}_{HST}(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{Theory}^{HST}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-规则、证明与可导性\">6. 规则、证明与可导性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to C}{C},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall x\\,A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{C}\\ (A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{HST}C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to C}{C},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall x\\,A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{C}\\ (A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{HST}C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{HST}=\\{((A,A\\to C),C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{HST}=\\{((A),\\forall x\\,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{HST}=\\{((A,A\\to C),C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{HST}=\\{((A),\\forall x\\,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{HST}=\\{((A),C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST},A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{HST}C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{HST}=\\{((A),C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST},A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{HST}C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>-证明是非空有限列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}\\)</span> 且至少满足下列一项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{HST}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{HST}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{HST}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{HST}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(C)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}(C)\\)</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{HST}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{HST}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{HST}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{HST}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{HST}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{HST}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是上述末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>-证明。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{HST}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{HST}A\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{HST}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{HST}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-目标差异\">7. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>HST 的目标差异由标准与内部两个原始层级谓词以及一个内部有限谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S,\\quad I,\\quad F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S,\\quad I,\\quad F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及派生外部域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ExtSet(x):=\\neg I(x)\">\\(ExtSet(x):=\\neg I(x)\\)</span>、层级桥接公理和扩大公理族\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Enlarge}^{HST}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Enlarge}^{HST}\\)</span> 给出；它不同于 Nelson IST 的单一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"st\">\\(st\\)</span> 谓词，也不同于 EST 把外部性作为原始谓词的语言。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-系统元组\">8. 系统元组</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{HST}=\n(\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},\\mathsf{Term}_{HST},\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST},\\operatorname{Int}_{HST},\\operatorname{StdFrm}_{HST},\\operatorname{FinFrm}_{HST},\n\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST},\\operatorname{FV}_{HST},\\operatorname{BV}_{HST},\n\\operatorname{fresh}_{HST},\\operatorname{SubTerm}_{HST},\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST},\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{HST},\nS,I,F,Set_{HST},StdSet,IntSet,ExtSet,FinIntSet,\\operatorname{StdFIP}_{HST},\n\\operatorname{cl}_{HST},\\mathsf{Ax}_{HST},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{HST},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{HST},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{HST},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{HST},\\vdash_{HST}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{HST}=\n(\\mathsf{Var}_{HST},\\mathsf{Term}_{HST},\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST},\\operatorname{Int}_{HST},\\operatorname{StdFrm}_{HST},\\operatorname{FinFrm}_{HST},\n\\operatorname{FVTerm}_{HST},\\operatorname{FV}_{HST},\\operatorname{BV}_{HST},\n\\operatorname{fresh}_{HST},\\operatorname{SubTerm}_{HST},\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST},\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{HST},\nS,I,F,Set_{HST},StdSet,IntSet,ExtSet,FinIntSet,\\operatorname{StdFIP}_{HST},\n\\operatorname{cl}_{HST},\\mathsf{Ax}_{HST},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{HST},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{HST},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{HST},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{HST},\\vdash_{HST}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只给出 HST 的三谓词集合语言、公理族、推理规则和有限证明关系；不包含 Nelson IST 的单一标准谓词语言、满足关系或解释结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"298-Hrbacek-集合论-HST","text":"298 Hrbacek 集合论 HST","level":1},{"id":"1.-三谓词集合语言","text":"1. 三谓词集合语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式闭包与内部公式","text":"2. 公式闭包与内部公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换与-alpha-等价","text":"3. 自由变量、替换与 alpha 等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-内部集合公理核心","text":"4. 内部集合公理核心","level":1},{"id":"5.-HST-标准、内部与扩大公理","text":"5. HST 标准、内部与扩大公理","level":1},{"id":"6.-规则、证明与可导性","text":"6. 规则、证明与可导性","level":1},{"id":"7.-目标差异","text":"7. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"8.-系统元组","text":"8. 系统元组","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_{HST}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{HST}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}_{HST}(U)=v_m,\n\\qquad m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin U\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"x\\doteq y,\\quad x\\in y,\\quad S(x),\\quad I(x),\\quad F(x).","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\neg,\\to,\\forall x","display":false},{"tex":"A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{HST}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{HST}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg A,\n\\qquad\nA\\wedge C:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg C),","display":true},{"tex":"A\\vee C:=\\neg A\\to C,\n\\qquad\nA\\leftrightarrow C:=(A\\to C)\\wedge(C\\to A),","display":true},{"tex":"x\\subseteq y:=\\forall z(z\\in x\\to z\\in y),\n\\qquad z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{HST}(\\{x,y\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{HST}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{HST}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{HST}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall^Sx\\,A:=\\forall x(S(x)\\to A),\\quad\n\\exists^Sx\\,A:=\\exists x(S(x)\\wedge A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall^Ix\\,A:=\\forall x(I(x)\\to A),\\quad\n\\exists^Ix\\,A:=\\exists x(I(x)\\wedge A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in a\\,A:=\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x\\in a\\,A:=\\exists x(x\\in a\\wedge A)","display":false},{"tex":"Set_